#: setup.php:177
msgid "Keep Alert History For"
msgstr "Pa Ìtàn Ìkìlọ̀ Mọ́ Fún"

#: setup.php:178
msgid "Enter how many days, weeks or months to keep alert history, or choose Indefinitely to keep everything (the number is then ignored). Maximum 3650 days, 520 weeks or 120 months. A purge job runs with the Cacti poller and removes aged events with their decisions, deliveries and attempts. Active conditions and queued or failed work are never purged. Each collector purges its own history."
msgstr "Tẹ iye ọjọ́, ọ̀sẹ̀ tàbí oṣù láti pa ìtàn ìkìlọ̀ mọ́, tàbí yan Títí láé láti pa ohun gbogbo mọ́ (a ó kọbiara sí nọ́ńbà náà). Pọ̀ jùlọ jẹ́ ọjọ́ 3650, ọ̀sẹ̀ 520 tàbí oṣù 120. Iṣẹ́ ìfọmọ́ ń ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú olùkójọpọ̀ Cacti ó sì ń yọ àwọn ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ àtijọ́ pẹ̀lú ìpinnu, ìfijiṣẹ́ àti ìgbìyànjú wọn kúrò. A kì í fọ àwọn ipò tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ àti iṣẹ́ tí ó wà lórí ìlà tàbí tí ó kùnà kúrò. Olùkójọ kọ̀ọ̀kan ń fọ ìtàn tirẹ̀ kúrò."

